          ]
        },
        "202170002": {
          "id": 202170002,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1415,
          "text": "名为「昔涟」的少女，怎么会轻易离开呢~",
          "next": [
            202170003
          ]
        },
        "202170003": {
          "id": 202170003,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1415,
          "text": "今天也是美好的一天。当然，要有鲜花的点缀♪",
          "next": [
            202170004
          ]
        },
        "202170004": {
          "id": 202170004,
          "type": "Sticker",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1415,
          "next": [
            202170005
          ]
        },
        "202170005": {
          "id": 202170005,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1415,
          "text": "啊呀，挑选花束的时候我可费了一番心思",
          "next": [
            202170006
          ]
        },
        "202170006": {
          "id": 202170006,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1415,
          "text": "七彩的水晶玫瑰，从一粒种子开始，由人家亲手培育而成~",
          "next": [
            202170007
          ]
        },
        "202170007": {
          "id": 202170007,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1415,
          "text": "嘻，还有遐蝶花园里的安提灵花，每一瓣都沾着露水",
          "next": [
            202170008
          ]
        },
        "202170008": {
          "id": 202170008,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1415,
          "text": "向日葵与风铃草，来自风堇的庭院，就像温和的阳光~",
          "next": [
            202170009
          ]
        },
        "202170009": {
          "id": 202170009,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1415,
          "text": "还有月光蓝百合，满天星，白桔梗……",
          "next": [
            202170010
          ]
        },
        "202170010": {
          "id": 202170010,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1415,
          "text": "嘻，你猜…人家心中最满意的搭配是什么？",
          "next": [
            202170011
          ]
        },
        "202170011": {
          "id": 202170011,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1415,
          "text": "铛铛，一束哀丽秘榭的麦穗！",
          "next": [
            202170012
          ]
        },
        "202170012": {
          "id": 202170012,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1415,
          "text": "{NICKNAME}收到时，记得要闭上双眼，麦香会带你回到那片小村庄",
          "next": [
            202170013
          ]
        },
        "202170013": {
          "id": 202170013,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1415,
          "text": "就像我们那时在秋千上高高荡起，远方的潮水拍打着岸，麦浪在脚下翻涌……",
          "next": [
            202170014
          ]
        },
        "202170014": {
          "id": 202170014,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1415,
          "text": "更多的惊喜，就留给{NICKNAME}自己去发现啦",
          "next": [
            202170015
          ]
        },
        "202170015": {
          "id": 202170015,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1415,
          "text": "即便人家不能一起，也要仔细阅读卡片上的心意哟？",
          "next": [
            202170016
          ]
        },
        "202170016": {
          "id": 202170016,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1415,
          "text": "希望{NICKNAME}的每一天，都有鲜花的陪伴呀♪",
          "next": [
            202170017,
            202170018,
            202170019
          ]
        },
        "202170017": {
          "id": 202170017,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "谢谢你，昔涟",
          "next": [
            202170020
          ]
        },
        "202170018": {
          "id": 202170018,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "你的心意，我收到了",
